    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.009",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 9,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 172,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 48,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Keep the original.",
        "Keep thinking."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9a20d81389ce",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 302,
      "width": 334,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 18,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 26.099999999999998,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "A record of the past does not have to",
        "freeze the present."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-f864ef4d1cbb",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.011",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 376,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA · Editorial draft for publication review"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b6b352df7872",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.012",
      "kind": "photograph",
      "paint_order": 12,
      "asset": "architecture",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 432,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 235,
      "rotation": -0.6,
      "crop_xywh": [
        23.59,
        0.0,
        1552.83,
        1067.0
      ],
      "position": [
        0.5,
        0.5
      ],
      "arch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 726,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "You may recognize an old idea and",
        "immediately want to improve the wording.",
        "A sentence was too long. A constraint is",
        "no longer relevant. A rough question",
        "deserves a clearer shape. Making the",
        "archive useful means allowing this kind of",
        "work, not treating every saved word as",
        "untouchable."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-60638d5b24f6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.014",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 989,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "At the same time, the past should not be",
        "silently rewritten. If you compare how",
        "your thinking changed, today’s polished",
        "version cannot stand in for what you",
        "actually wrote last month. A working",
        "archive has to meet both needs."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dca98617c2a7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1194,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA distinguishes the original source",
        "from the editable working version. The",
        "source provides a way back to what",
        "happened. The working version gives you",
        "a place to make the material readable and",
        "useful now. Neither needs to pretend to",
        "be the other."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8f1e28d061a9",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.016",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1448,
      "x2": 104,
      "y2": 1448,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.017",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1490,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 35,
      "font_style": "italic",
      "line_height": 43,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "The useful amount may",
        "be",
        "three sentences, not three",
        "years."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1736,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Optional AI assistance adds another",
        "layer, not another owner. A clearer",
        "presentation can be helpful, but it must",
        "remain distinguishable from source",
        "material and human edits. An automatic",
        "update should not quietly discard the",
        "work you have already done."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3d84d3d596a0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1970,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "When it is time to reuse something, the",
        "useful version depends on the task. You",
        "may need the original quotation, a current",
        "working summary or a few selected",
        "passages. Previewing the material is part",
        "of the choice, not an obstacle to getting it",
        "out of the archive."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b1ed7845f895",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2204,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 29,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "Continuity does not mean never changing",
        "your mind. It means having a readable",
        "relationship between what you said then,",
        "what you think now and what you choose",
        "to do next."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-99fc79b62de8",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2406,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 15.95,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "A product perspective, not a claim of released capability."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-edits-en-390.022",
